  "description": "Killed / cancelled Postgres queries from the logs (state_code 57014 query_canceled, 57P01 admin_shutdown). pg_stat_statements never records these, so this is the only faithful view. Filtered to the app user on pg-fmp; expand a log row to read the statement (SQL). #23",
